LE ARE BASICALLY CONSERVATIVES. AMONG BAZARGAN'S CLOSEST COWORKERS, [REDACTION] APPEARS THE MOST RADICAL, BUT THAT PROBABLY STEMS FROM THE ROLE HE IS PLAYING AS A BRIDGE BETWEEN THE GOVERNMENT AND THE COMMITTEES.","query_utf8_sha256":"afa0eca6595a3a1d6c56445825c8c8b36ce98c60523a96dd2f99a31cf539910e","task":"redaction"},{"assessments":[{"config":"llm_readings","native_checkpoint":{"path":"phase/source_showcase_20261125/epochs/release_controls_v1/review_vietnam_h_highlands_withdrawal_air_resupply_v1/native.json.gz","sha256":"cb5a7d2856a5ffb0e2e331f434746b2a8c395207621d0238d782bd1551956a26"},"native_checksum":"8fbd96545c28f37fe18a38e1230d39bf06959d0bf888df2ba09781ad6f153f4e","readings":[],"status":"PARTIAL_SUPPORT"}],"case_id":"review_vietnam_h_highlands_withdrawal_air_resupply_v1","corpus":"vietnam","date":"1975-03-19","document_id":"1975SAIGON03129","origin_refs":{"masked":{"path":"phase/source_showcase_20261125/origin_entries/release_controls_v1/review_vietnam_h_highlands_withdrawal_air_resupply_v1/origins/review_vietnam_h_highlands_withdrawal_air_resupply_v1/masked.json.gz","sha256":"5433d57ab86b4127369eada180ebdb590b04673ebcae851d721e015f56fd0117"}},"query":"The GVN decision to withdraw from Kontum and Pleiku was felt necessary in order not to be spread so thin in the face of the wide-ranging NVA pressure. With the principal LOC's between the coast and the highlands cut, resupply could only have been effected by air.","query_utf8_sha256":"cba7164ce514c717868f0f27c7e36d7c726ae5bae324ba21bafa85f37de9e151","task":"hypothesis"},{"assessments":[{"config":"llm_readings","native_checkpoint":{"path":"phase/source_showcase_20261125/epochs/release_controls_v1/showcase_vietnam_m_march19_mr3_delta_v1/native.json.gz","sha256":"8bb16a855ddaa0ad2d8b641f22286b9b8836ef5f4b7c332d9c49a5d78938b7a1"},"native_checksum":"12b6da2b21b0ba3ff35788cda6e64d77e1ed4e3767342e22e2d1b550f78efcb1","readings":[],"status":"EVIDENCE_BACKED_RECONSTRUCTION"}],"case_id":"showcase_vietnam_m_march19_mr3_de